If you are using Microsoft CoPilot for home click on settings>personalization then paste the text from SocraticSieve into the custom instructions and click save instructions.
If you are using Microsoft Copilot for Business you need to use the copiolot-SocraticSieve modification.
If you are using any other AI Application load the LLM and paste in the SocraticSieve as the first message to the prompt.  It has been tested with multiple LLMs but it does not do well on smaller models.
There may be additional changes necessary as AI evolves.  If you become aware of them, please add them to the issues section.
